#: admin.py:168
msgid ""
"A key is stored encrypted. Leave blank to keep it, or enter a new key to "
"replace it. The stored value cannot be viewed."
msgstr ""
"Ključ je shranjen šifrirano. Pustite prazno, da ga ohranite, ali vnesite "
"nov ključ za zamenjavo. Shranjene vrednosti ni mogoče videti."

#: admin.py:173
msgid ""
"Entered once, stored encrypted, and cannot be viewed again. Leave empty to "
"use OPENROUTER_API_KEY / settings.OPENROUTER['API_KEY']."
msgstr ""
"Vnešen je enkrat, shranjen šifrirano in ga ni mogoče ponovno videti. "
"Pustite prazno za uporabo OPENROUTER_API_KEY / settings.OPENROUTER['API_KEY']."

